<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="policy-page">
  <div class="policy-container">
    <a href="/listings" class="policy-back">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to StayNest
    </a>

    <header class="policy-header">
      <span class="policy-badge">PLEASE READ CAREFULLY</span>
      <h1>Terms of <span>Service</span></h1>
      <p>
        These terms explain the basic rules for accessing and using the StayNest
        platform.
      </p>
      <div class="policy-updated">
        <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i>
        Last updated: October 30, 2026
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="policy-layout">
      <nav class="policy-toc">
        <h3>On this page</h3>
        <a href="#acceptance">Acceptance of Terms</a>
        <a href="#eligibility">Eligibility and Accounts</a>
        <a href="#platform">Our Platform</a>
        <a href="#booking">Bookings and Payments</a>
        <a href="#hosts">Listing Responsibilities</a>
        <a href="#conduct">User Conduct</a>
        <a href="#cancellation">Cancellations</a>
        <a href="#liability">Liability</a>
        <a href="#changes">Changes to Terms</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
      </nav>

      <article class="policy-content">
        <section id="acceptance" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">01</span>
          <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using StayNest, you agree to comply with these Terms
            of Service and applicable laws. If you do not agree with these
            terms, please do not use the platform.
          </p>
          <p>
            Additional terms may apply to particular features or services when
            those terms are presented to you.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="eligibility" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">02</span>
          <h2>Eligibility and Accounts</h2>
          <p>
            You must be legally capable of entering into a binding agreement to
            use StayNest independently. If you are not, you may use the platform
            only with the involvement and authorization of a responsible person
            where permitted by law.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Provide accurate information when creating an account.</li>
            <li>Keep your login credentials confidential.</li>
            <li>Notify us if you suspect unauthorized account access.</li>
            <li>
              Do not impersonate another person or create accounts using
              misleading information.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We may restrict or suspend accounts when reasonably necessary to
            address violations, fraud, or security risks.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="platform" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">03</span>
          <h2>About StayNest</h2>
          <p>
            StayNest is a platform designed to help users discover accommodation
            listings and explore booking options.
          </p>
          <p>
            Listing information may be provided by property owners or other
            contributors. Users should review property descriptions, location,
            pricing, availability, and other relevant details before making a
            decision.
          </p>
          <p>
            Unless expressly stated otherwise, displaying a property does not
            guarantee its availability or confirm a reservation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="booking" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">04</span>
          <h2>Bookings and Payments</h2>
          <p>
            A booking request or reservation is subject to the booking process,
            availability, and any confirmation requirements displayed on the
            platform.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Review the selected dates, number of guests, and total price
              before proceeding.
            </li>
            <li>
              Prices, taxes, and additional charges should be disclosed before
              payment.
            </li>
            <li>
              Never treat a booking request as confirmed unless confirmation has
              been provided.
            </li>
            <li>
              Use only payment methods officially supported by the platform.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            If online payment functionality is introduced, the applicable
            payment terms and refund procedures should be provided before
            payment is accepted.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="hosts" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">05</span>
          <h2>Listing Responsibilities</h2>
          <p>
            Users who publish listings are responsible for ensuring that the
            information they submit is accurate and that they are authorized to
            offer the accommodation.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Provide truthful descriptions, photographs, and location details.
            </li>
            <li>Keep prices and availability information accurate.</li>
            <li>
              Do not publish unlawful, misleading, or unauthorized content.
            </li>
            <li>
              Respect applicable property, safety, and accommodation
              requirements.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            StayNest may review, restrict, or remove listings that violate these
            terms or applicable law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="conduct" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">06</span>
          <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p>You agree not to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Use the platform for fraudulent, unlawful, or deceptive
              activities.
            </li>
            <li>
              Attempt to access another user's account without authorization.
            </li>
            <li>Interfere with website security or normal operation.</li>
            <li>Upload malicious code or abuse platform functionality.</li>
            <li>Post content that infringes another person's rights.</li>
            <li>Submit fake reviews or manipulate listing information.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="cancellation" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">07</span>
          <h2>Cancellations and Refunds</h2>
          <p>
            Cancellation eligibility, refund amounts, and applicable deadlines
            depend on the policy presented for the specific reservation.
          </p>
          <p>
            Before confirming a booking, carefully review its cancellation
            terms. Where a refund process is offered, the applicable payment
            provider's processing timelines may also affect when funds arrive.
          </p>
          <p>
            StayNest's actual cancellation and refund rules must be displayed
            clearly before a customer completes a real reservation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="liability" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">08</span>
          <h2>Disclaimers and Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the extent permitted by law, StayNest does not guarantee
            uninterrupted or error-free access to the platform, nor does
            displaying a listing independently verify every claim made about a
            property.
          </p>
          <p>
            Nothing in these terms excludes or limits any consumer right,
            responsibility, or liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or
            limited.
          </p>
          <p>
            Users should exercise appropriate care when evaluating listings and
            making accommodation arrangements.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="changes" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">09</span>
          <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may update these terms as the platform develops or when changes
            are needed for operational or legal reasons.
          </p>
          <p>
            Updated terms will be published on this page with a revised date.
            Where required by law, we will provide additional notice or seek
            consent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">10</span>
          <h2>Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about these Terms of Service, contact the
            StayNest team through your designated support channel.
          </p>
          <div class="policy-contact-card">
            <div class="policy-contact-icon">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>StayNest support</h3>
              <p>
                Contact the StayNest team for questions about platform use and
                bookings.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="policy-notice">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
          <p>
            These terms are a general project template, not legal advice. Review
            them against your actual services and applicable law before using
            StayNest for real bookings.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
